{
  "name": "Daily arXiv & Hugging Face Trending AI Research Papers Summary Digest to Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Daily arXiv & Hugging Face Trending AI Research Papers Summary Digest to Slack\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nFetch the top trending AI papers from arXiv and Hugging Face daily, summarize key findings with an LLM, and post to Slack.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/arxiv-hf-paper-summary-citation-extractor`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/arxiv-hf-paper-summary-citation-extractor) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify arXiv & Hugging Face AI Paper Extractor** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "632e916c-47fc-4aa8-ab06-ef1ff272683b",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **arXiv & Hugging Face AI Paper Extractor** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "2a1de5d7-7fd6-4563-a3f7-45d4562f5824",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "bd14c272-cc3c-4601-ab07-5745404fb06c",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "22d95bed-f304-48bc-a2a8-edc80761d961",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b2242e25-5477-4308-a559-8eb35398f888",
              "name": "queries",
              "value": "[\"multi-agent LLM orchestration\",\"retrieval augmented generation reasoning\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "e86dfc18-3b91-48df-ac1f-3d61ee024017",
              "name": "maxItems",
              "value": 25,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "698e3b47-b9b2-4407-a02e-7d78b7173a72",
              "name": "pipelineCategory",
              "value": "AI, RAG & Tech",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "8b3c9443-a6de-4359-ad27-8c99369f3c69",
      "name": "Configure Target Queries",
